# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Noko Funerals — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Copy to .env.local for development. In production set these in the Vercel
#  dashboard (Project → Settings → Environment Variables).
#
#  NOTHING here is required to run the proposal demo. The enquiry form is
#  deliberately not connected to anything — see docs/IMPLEMENTATION-NOTES.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The canonical site URL, used for metadata and Open Graph tags.
# Leave unset locally and on previews: the app falls back to the Vercel
# deployment URL automatically.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://nokofunerals.co.za

# ── For when the enquiry form is connected (not used yet) ────────────────────
# Where completed enquiries should be delivered.
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=info@nokofunerals.co.za

# Transactional email provider key. Keep this server-side only: never prefix a
# secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_, or it will be bundled into the browser.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
